# Spaghetti Prevention

One primary responsibility per file:

| File | Allowed |
|------|---------|
| `router.go` | Route registration only |
| `handlers/*.go` | HTTP in/out, call services |
| `services/*.go` | Business rules |
| `repositories/*.go` | GORM queries |

**Never** combine router + handler + DB in one file.

Run `make ai-spaghetti` after structural changes.
